        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Wonderful detached home which perfectly captures the character and charm that define life in Dalkey. This striking four-bedroom detached period residence extends to approximately 206 sq. metres and showcases an abundance of original features, timeless elegance and distinctive architectural detail throughout.\r\n\r\nTucked away just off Ardeevin Road and Cunningham Road, the property offers an exceptional combination of accessibility and privacy. It is only a short stroll from Dalkey DART Station, ensuring quick and convenient access to the city centre, while being moments from Dalkey’s renowned cafés, restaurants, boutiques and scenic coastal walks. Despite its highly convenient setting, the property enjoys a remarkable sense of peace and seclusion. Vehicular access is provided via Cunningham Road, with additional pedestrian access from Ardeevin Road.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is rich in period detail, creating a warm and welcoming ambience. The accommodation is generously proportioned and thoughtfully laid out, making it equally suited to relaxed family living and refined entertaining.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, a wonderfully private garden benefits from an all-day sunny orientation, designed to capture maximum natural light. Attractive sea views add a further layer of appeal, providing a stunning coastal outlook. A detached garage and excellent access enhance the overall functionality of this exceptional property.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nDetached period home extending to approx. 206 sq. metres\r\n\r\nFour well-proportioned bedrooms\r\n\r\nSea views\r\n\r\nShort walk to Dalkey DART Station\r\n\r\nVehicular access via Cunningham Road\r\n\r\nOriginal period features throughout\r\n\r\nPrivate rear garden with all-day sun"
      }
